{"kind":"report","text":"Approved exact head 3f26e8c5d476e624b6963a76fa3d125280715711 on request/mcp-late-actor-resolution, third filing of #10952. Recut confirmed clean: the added hunks are line-for-line identical to d22565108 and the sole message delta is the Rests-On trailer naming git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:181e28af07520a0dcb9356f7ec72439e4479f7b0 exactly. ARCHITECTURE: additive change across layers 5-7 - new Workspace.ResolveActor (internal/app/app.go:612) answers from in-memory custody first and, only on a miss, takes rereadMu, double-checks memory, loads fresh custody once and adopts it, so later calls stay pure memory; MCP call sites attach (main.go:654), whoami (:876), warnSharedIdentity (:1189) and fingerprint (digest.go:66) switch to it. No existing contract changes; docs/reference/architecture.md untouched as no contract moved. SECURITY: error-distinction honesty holds - unknown-actor wording is asserted only after LoadConfig succeeded (app.go:624-632), so a live actor is never reported unknown; there is no actor-removal path anywhere in internal/app or apphost, so the resolve-to-use window surfaces as a distinct I/O error rather than absence, making the TOCTOU benign; the miss path is serialised under rereadMu with double-checked re-read. Noted and judged acceptable against this request conditions: rereadMu is process-global, not per-workspace as the commit message claims - coarser than stated but functionally safe single-flight; attach classifies errors by message string (main.go:654) where a sentinel would be sturdier; fingerprint collapses a transient custody read failure into match-nothing (digest.go:69-71, acknowledged at source); with no negative cache a persistently-unknown name pays one config read per attach. SIMPLIFICATION: hit path already memory-only; candidate future cuts are a sentinel error for the string match and per-workspace lock scoping, neither required by this request. VERIFICATION RERUN AT THE EXACT TREE: go build ./... and go vet ./... green; go test ./cmd/gitseq-mcp/... -count=1 and ./internal/app/... -count=1 green, including TestAdapterResolvesActorAddedAfterSessionStart, TestResolveActorFindsActorAddedAfterOpen and TestResolveActorErrorCasesStayApart.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:4158fefcd9cdf84f0ef6a797692771ba041a4305","head":"3f26e8c5d476e624b6963a76fa3d125280715711","verdict":"approved"}}